# Release announcements (X.com)

When cutting a versioned release (for example 5.1):

1. Write an **English** announcement suitable for posting on X.com.
2. Save it as `post/x/{version}.txt` (example: `post/x/5.1.txt`). Use the plain version number without a leading `v`.
3. Include the GitHub release URL when known (`https://github.com/vitroid/Yaplot/releases/tag/v{version}`).
4. Keep the text concise enough to post; expand only if needed for clarity.
5. Commit the announcement file with the release (version bump / tag) so history stays with the project.
